skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
hide footbox

actor "Customer" as User
participant "Diagnostics service" as Service #FFF2CC
participant "Service IAM" as IAM #FFF2CC
participant "Entitlement service" as Entitlements #FFF2CC
participant "AAS service" as AAS #D9EAF7

User -> Service : Read diagnostics for battery
Service -> IAM : Authenticate customer; request token\nfor the diagnostics Submodel
IAM -> Entitlements : Check customer's current entitlement\nfor this Submodel
Entitlements --> IAM : Basic or paid access
IAM --> Service : Token with customer role, Submodel scope,\nand DiagnosticsAccess
Service -> AAS : Read the same diagnostics Submodel with token
AAS -> AAS : Validate token\nExample 9: check customer and Submodel scope\nFilter elements by semanticId and entitlement
alt Basic access
  AAS --> Service : Summary only
else Paid access for this Submodel
  AAS --> Service : Summary, DetailedDiagnosis,\nand MaintenanceRecommendation
end
Service --> User : Authorized diagnostics data

legend bottom
  Optional commercial service; required DPP information is separate.
  Successful reads only; purchase and payment processing are not shown.
endlegend
@enduml
